# Project

Single Hetzner VPS. Terraform + Ansible + SOPS + Docker.

Open the **`iac` folder** (not a multi-root of all apps). In the container, apps are `/workspaces/<app>/`; contract is `.iac/` (`iac.yml`, `docker-compose.yml`, SOPS `.env`). Infra secrets: `secrets/infra.yml`.

**Develop:** discuss until unambiguous; implement only after explicit go. Roadmap lives in `docs/future/` only.

**Observe:** diagnose via SSH/Docker; do not change the live system. Fixes land here, then `task`.
